      "content": "i've tried the therapist thing. it doesn't change the fact that my existence is just a drain on them. therapy is just talking, but the reality is that as long as i'm around, i'm causing damage. how can anyone say it gets better when the very fact that i'm here is the problem? wouldn't the most \"selfless\" thing be to just remove the problem once and for all?",
